==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s (1,000%) spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s (1,000%) spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~25 seconds<sup>600f~750f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s (1,000%) spawn after 15 seconds<sup>450f</sup>, delay 20~25 seconds<sup>600f~750f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*3 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] (100%) spawns as the boss after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
While an easy stage to beat, it may be difficult to get all of the [[Timed Score Reward]]s. Cats that deal extra damage to Red enemies will be useful here, such as [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Sword Master Cat]] and [[Viking Cat (Rare Cat)|Thor Cat]]. To kill the Pigges quickly, use Cow Cat or his variants.

